=== MDV-P5-012
title: Health-exchange pull and push for the launch emirate (Malaffi / NABIDH / Riayati) (N-07)
type: Story
epic: MDV-P5-E03
prd: P5-04
screens: N-07
covers: dep:1
priority: MUST
roles: Doctor, Practice admin
labels: hie, uae, interop
