depends: MDV-P5-011, MDV-P1-046
confidence: 40 | Regulator onboarding and conformance testing control the dates; one integration module, three configurations.
sources: design/Medvya Gap Analysis (G-01); PRD v2 P5-04; docs/03-architecture/integrations.md
desc:
Integration worker module: patient registration/search by EID at check-in, pull allergies, diagnoses, medicines, labs and discharge summaries into the timeline labelled with source; push every signed visit (HL7 v2/FHIR per programme). Status screen (N-07) shows connection health and per-encounter push status.
ac:
- Conformance testing passed for the launch emirate (evidence stored).
- Pulled data appears with "Exchange" provenance and is never merged into verified chart data without clinician acceptance.
- Every signed visit is pushed with receipt; failures retry and are visible in N-07.
- India launch is not blocked if this slips (scope rule from PRD).

