confidence: 70 | Mostly process/documentation; ADHICS evidence depends on UAE scope.
sources: PRD v2 P5-11; docs/04-security-compliance/README.md#compliance-artefacts-and-when-they-are-due
desc:
Incident response plan with breach-notification steps and timelines for DPDP and UAE regulators; Defender for Cloud and Microsoft Sentinel analytic rules routed to on-call (bulk reads/exports, failed logins, privilege changes); Customer Lockbox enabled; vulnerability disclosure policy; ADHICS control evidence pack (if UAE); ISO 27001 readiness gap assessment.
ac:
- IR plan tested in a tabletop (breach scenario) with timings recorded.
- Alerts for bulk export, anomalous access and privilege escalation reach on-call within 15 minutes in a test.
- VDP published on the trust centre; Customer Lockbox enabled.
- Gap assessment lists ISO 27001 controls with status and owners.

=== MDV-P5-025
title: Retention and deletion jobs per country; patient access/correction/erasure requests for clinics
type: Story
epic: MDV-P5-E06
prd: P5-12
screens: H-10
priority: MUST
roles: Practice owner, System
labels: retention, data-rights, privacy
estimate: 3
weeks: 29-30
depends: MDV-P3-019, MDV-P0-024
confidence: 68 | Retention periods need legal confirmation; enterprise H-10 workflow is P7.
sources: PRD v2 P5-12; design/Medvya Enterprise Pages (H-10 patterns)
desc:
Scheduled jobs apply each country's record-retention rule (audio, transcripts, notes, documents, billing, audit) with legal-hold support; clinic-level handling of patient requests: access (export of the patient's record), correction (with audit, clinical content via addendum), erasure (where lawful; medical records under retention hold explained), withdrawal of recording consent (audio purge with receipt).
ac:
- Retention jobs delete only data past its period and not under legal hold; deletions logged without PHI.
- Access requests produce a patient export within the legal deadline, tracked with due dates.
- Erasure requests explain partial fulfilment when retention law applies (status "Partially fulfilled · legal hold").
- Recording-consent withdrawal purges audio and records the purge receipt.

